Lua 5.4.7, from https://www.lua.org/ftp/lua-5.4.7.tar.gz
(sha256 9fbf5e28ef86c69858f6d3d34eccc32e911c1a28b4120ff3e84aaa70cfbf1e30).

src/ is the tarball's src/ unchanged, minus lua.c, luac.c and the Makefile.
It is compiled as C++, from one translation unit, by src/map/lua_vm.cpp --
so neither the configure/Makefile build nor CMake needed a new library.

Used by src/map/skill_lua.cpp: skill hooks that mods write in Lua.
